        "text_preview": "\n6) The aforesaid order was challenged by the respondent by way of an appeal under Section 29 of the DV Act before the learned Principal Sessions Judge, Kupwara, who, vide order dated 06.08.2021 dismissed the appeal and gave liberty to the "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fe952afbe99f44e481b0a10ed4a2c4b3_14",
